A_views_a_stellar_explosion_in_Orion.jpg/500px-ALMA_views_a_stellar_explosion_in_Orion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"ALMA observations of the Orion Nebula complex provide insights into explosions at star birth.[19]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AALMA_views_a_stellar_explosion_in_Orion.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Size_can_be_deceptive_ESO_553-46.jpg/500px-Size_can_be_deceptive_ESO_553-46.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Size_can_be_deceptive_ESO_553-46.jpg/500px-Size_can_be_deceptive_ESO_553-46.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dwarf galaxy ESO 553-46 has one of the highest rates of star formation of the 1000 or so galaxies nearest to the Milky Way.[24]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASize_can_be_deceptive_ESO_553-46.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/LH_95.jpg/500px-LH_95.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/LH_95.jpg/1280px-LH_95.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/LH_95.jpg/500px-LH_95.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"LH 95 stellar nursery in Large Magellanic Cloud","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALH_95.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Cepheus_B.jpg/500px-Cepheus_B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Cepheus_B.jpg/1280px-Cepheus_B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikiped